\f2\i0\b \cf0 General study design\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\ri0\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0 \cf0 The data represents environmental samples that were collected from Jones Sound and Nares Strait in 2019 and 2021. It comprises physical, biogeochemical, and biological transcriptional data.\cell \row

