\f2\i0\b \cf0 Methods description\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\ri0\partightenfactor0

\f1\i\b0 \cf0 The majority of the procedures used to collected the data can be found in full in White et al. (2025) and Bhatia et al (2021). This includes sampling locations, methods for collecting and processing physical, and biogeochemical data. \
\
New to this analysis is the transcriptional data. For transcriptomics seawater was filtered and RNA was extracted. Sequencing was done on a NovaSeq6000, 150bp PE.post processing was done using Eukrythmic with assembly (MEGAHIT + rnaSPAdes) and clustering (MMSeqs2), while taxonomical annotations were done with EUKulele. Dab proteins were identified via BLASTp against known references in NCBI. For phylogenies, DabA/C/D and mitochondrial markers (tatA, cox1) aligned, trimmed, and used to build ML phylogenies (IQ-TREE, ModelFinder, 1000 bootstraps) to place the Pseudo-nitzschia and Nitzschia sequences.\
\cell \row

