\f0\i0 \cf0 CTD sensor data (Temperature, Salinity, Dissolved O2, Turbidity, Chlorophyll a)
\f2\b \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\ri0\sb100\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 Measured in situ with an RBR maestro3 multichannel CTD logger (conductivity, temperature, pressure, DO, Chl a, turbidity sensors). Logger was soaked at 5 m for at least a minute prior to taking measurements. Logger was lowered in the water a speed of ~0.5 m/s and downcast data was used in analyses. Data was processed in Ruskin software and the TEOS-10 GSW Oceanographic Toolbox, binned to 1-m depth intervals.
\f1\i \cell \row

