\f0\i0 \cf0 Macronutrients (SiO4, PO4, NO2, NO3, NH3)
\f2\b \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\ri0\sb100\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 Seawater was collected from GO-FLOs and hand filtered with syringes through 0.22 \'b5m PES filters into 15mL clean tubes. Samples were frozen, and analyzed within 1 month on a Skalar SAN++ Continuous Flow Nutrient Analyzer (CERC.OCEAN Lab). Detection limits: NO3 0.3, NO2 0.15, NH3 0.01, PO4 0.2, SiO4 0.08 \'b5M.\cell \row

