\f2\b \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\ri0\sb100\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 Samples were collected from GO-FLO using all plastic syringes and PTFE filters into trace metal clean sampling containers. Samples pre-concentrations were measured on an acidified seaFAST-pico system (Nobias P1 resin; buffered to pH 6.2 \'b1 0.2 with ammonium acetate). Sample eluents were measured on an inductively coupled plasma mass spectrometer (Element XR; Thermo Scientific).\cell \row

