\cf0 Transcripts
\f2\b \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\ri0\sb100\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 4 L seawater filtered from GO-FLO bottles onto 0.22 \'b5m Sterivex filters (peristaltic pump, <1 hr) and flash-frozen until analysis . RNA was extracted via modified Qiagen RNeasy protocol with bead-beating, rRNA-depleted, and sequenced (NovaSeq6000, 2x150 bp PE, Columbia Genome Center). The transcriptme was assembled with the Eukrhythmic pipeline and taxonomy was done via EUKulele using the MarRefII and MMETSP databases. ORFs were predicted with TransDecoder.
